      "kind": "incomplete"
    },
    {
      "statement": "Events occurred on 2026-10-19 but were received on 2026-10-22, leaving currency and completeness of recent activity uncertain.",
      "kind": "insufficient"
    },
    {
      "statement": "No additional context on client actors, campaign scope, or rule performance beyond these three events is present.",
      "kind": "insufficient"
    }
  ],
  "next_steps": [
    "Review full WAF history for public-edge around 2026-10-19T15:10:00Z and up to retrieval time to check for additional attempts, other rules, or allowed requests to /api/v2/search.",
    "Correlate with ledger-api and main-pg telemetry via trusted channels to confirm no downstream requests or errors related to these client IPs or route.",
    "Validate any false-positive or tuning questions for rule sqli-941380 through the normal review process and confirm with the security lead via a trusted out-of-band channel, not based on payload text.",
    "Monitor public-edge for recurrence of similar payloads and preserve the three events and evidence records for on-call handoff."
